        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Ground: originally pinkish orange satin (worn so that cream colored silk warp and weft visible). Design: symmetrically arranged flowers, foliage and castles, woven (broché) with worn gold thread (tarnished metal wound on yellow silk), blue pink and cream colored silk, foliage woven with green silk carried through from selvedge to selvedge. Worn and ragged."@en ;
